        Attacks on Approximate Caches in Text-to-Image <span class="search-hit mathjax">Diffusion</span> Models
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sun%2C+D">Desen Sun</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jie%2C+S">Shuncheng Jie</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+S">Sihang Liu</a>
      
