    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Discrete <span class="search-hit mathjax">Diffusion</span> VLA: Bringing Discrete <span class="search-hit mathjax">Diffusion</span> to Action Decoding in Vision-Language-Action Policies
      
